        "meta-category": "threat-hunting",
        "description": "A single testable hypothesis from the Scope and Execute sections of a hunt: its scoping decision, targeted ATT&CK technique(s), and analytic reasoning. One instance per hypothesis.",
        "template_uuid": "4136cd18-3edd-49fb-90ba-24cbacacc662",
