          },
          {
            "uuid": "445c4f40-876a-5ce5-b498-7b37065212c9",
            "object_relation": "analysis",
            "type": "text",
            "category": "Other",
            "value": "- query-mfa-registrations [query]: kql against iam\n- query-helpdesk-resets [query]: kql against iam\n- query-rmm-installs [query]: kql against edr\n- correlate-identities [agent]: Correlate the MFA-registration, helpdesk-reset, and RMM-install results by identity and time. Flag identities matching the Scattered Spider chain: a helpdesk-initiated reset closely followed by MFA registration from an IP/ASN not previously associated with that user, and/or RMM tooling first appearing on that user's host in the same window. Distinguish genuine onboarding/refresh from takeover. Surface each flagged identity so downstream steps are scoped to it.\n- any-suspects [decision]: if correlate-identities.flagged > 0\n- pivot-persistence/query-federation-changes [query]: kql against iam\n- pivot-persistence/query-ir-surveillance [query]: kql against siem\n- assess-takeover [decision]: if taken together, the correlated evidence, federation changes, and IR-surveillance activity indicate an active identity takeover consistent with AA23-320A rather than benign IT activity\n- contain [action]: For each flagged identity: revoke sessions, disable the account, remove the\n- notify-out-of-band [task]: The actors monitor Teams/Slack/Exchange for IR discussion (AA23-320A) and may\n- manual-review [task]: Review the evidence for each flagged identity. Verify the original helpdesk\n- close-with-notes [task]: Record the benign explanation for the correlated events in the hunt log and",
            "to_ids": false,
            "disable_correlation": true
          },
          {
            "uuid": "ca067575-56d5-54d7-9dc8-b917d3a7d5b9",
            "object_relation": "status",
            "type": "text",
            "category": "Other",
            "value": "Not Started",
            "to_ids": false,
            "disable_correlation": true
          }
